WEBVTT

00:00:29.648 --> 00:00:31.251
[PO PANTING]

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:34.358
Oh-ooh!

00:00:34.385 --> 00:00:35.765
[GASPING]

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.132
Stairs.
这么多台阶

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.682
I don't think I can...
[GRUNTS]
我不行了

00:00:40.726 --> 00:00:42.902
You guys,
just start without me.
你们 别管我 先上去

00:00:43.685 --> 00:00:45.034
[PANTING]
你们 别管我 先上去

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.645
I'll catch up!
我一定会追上的

00:00:46.688 --> 00:00:48.148
[EXHALES FORCEFULLY]
我一定会追上的

00:00:48.472 --> 00:00:50.526
[CONTINUES PANTING]

00:00:50.652 --> 00:00:52.302
[GRUNTS]

00:00:53.129 --> 00:00:54.283
[CHUCKLES]

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:55.523
[SIGHS]

00:00:55.871 --> 00:00:57.351
Sweet.
真棒

00:00:59.222 --> 00:01:00.549
Ah.

00:01:16.283 --> 00:01:18.764
Inner peace.
心如止水 心如止水

00:01:18.807 --> 00:01:21.244
Inner peace.
心如止水 心如止水

00:01:23.769 --> 00:01:25.727
Itchy nose.
鼻子好痒啊

00:01:25.771 --> 00:01:27.198
[BLOWS]

00:01:28.382 --> 00:01:30.210
[SNEEZES]

00:01:32.299 --> 00:01:35.041
Finally, inner peace.
终于可以 心如止水了

00:01:36.216 --> 00:01:37.563
Now what?
又怎么了

00:01:49.446 --> 00:01:51.834
Kai, old friend.
天煞 老朋友

00:01:53.102 --> 00:01:55.757
Master Oogway.
乌龟大师

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:59.441
Our battle ended
500 years ago!
我们的较量五百年前就结束了

00:01:59.454 --> 00:02:01.894
Well, now I'm ready
for a rematch.
我现在想与你再战

00:02:01.937 --> 00:02:03.678
Took you long enough!
[LAUGHS]
你耽搁挺久啊

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:04.940
[GROWLS]
你耽搁挺久啊

00:02:08.465 --> 00:02:09.945
[YELLING]

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:16.666
[GRUNTS]

00:02:19.694 --> 00:02:21.435
You've grown stronger.
果然有长进啊

00:02:23.698 --> 00:02:24.925
[GRUNTS]

00:02:27.441 --> 00:02:32.185
500 years in the Spirit Realm,
you pick up a thing or two.
在灵界待了五百年 好歹学了几招

00:02:32.228 --> 00:02:36.226
I have taken the chi
of every master here.
我已经收走了这里所有大师的气

00:02:36.363 --> 00:02:38.757
[GASPS] No!
Yes.
没错 而且我很快也会收走你的气

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.455
And soon I will have
your power, too.
没错 而且我很快也会收走你的气

00:02:41.498 --> 00:02:43.525
When will you realize?
你什么时候才能够领悟

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:45.546
The more you take,
the less you have.
取之越多失之越多

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.107
[GRUNTS]

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.295
[KAI GRUNTING]

00:03:06.785 --> 00:03:08.185
With your chi,
有了你的气 我就终于可以重返凡界

00:03:08.208 --> 00:03:12.138
I will finally be able to return
to the mortal world.
有了你的气 我就终于可以重返凡界

00:03:12.181 --> 00:03:15.750
And this time, you won't be there
to stop me.
而这次 就算是你也无能为力

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:17.099
[SIGHS]
而这次 就算是你也无能为力

00:03:17.143 --> 00:03:19.972
It was never my destiny
to stop you.
不需要我来阻止你

00:03:20.015 --> 00:03:22.626
I have set another
on that path.
我把这个重任托付给了别人

00:03:28.415 --> 00:03:30.417
Then I will find him...
那我就找到他 也夺走他的气

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.680
and take his chi, too.
那我就找到他 也夺走他的气

00:03:50.611 --> 00:03:54.223
[YELLS]
Justice is about to be served!
正义来也

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:55.650
[YELLING]
正义来也

00:04:02.362 --> 00:04:04.407
Whoo-hoo!

00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:16.724
Yee-haw!

00:04:18.857 --> 00:04:20.641
[CONTINUES YELLING]

00:04:22.007 --> 00:04:23.035
[YELPS]

00:04:27.996 --> 00:04:31.043
[CONTINUES YELLING]

00:04:37.353 --> 00:04:38.734
[GRUNTS]

00:04:41.096 --> 00:04:43.055
[CONTINUES YELLING]

00:04:49.717 --> 00:04:51.023
We'll have two
Justice Platters, please.
我们要两份正义套餐

00:04:51.066 --> 00:04:52.277
Um... Three. Three.
我们要两份正义套餐

00:04:52.301 --> 00:04:53.323
And a few tofu buns.
三份 再来几个豆腐包

00:04:53.347 --> 00:04:54.678
Oh, the spicy noodle soup
for Tigress.
再来一个香辣面给娇虎 你要多加酱料吗

00:04:54.722 --> 00:04:55.840
Did you want
extra sauce with that?
再来一个香辣面给娇虎 你要多加酱料吗

00:04:55.854 --> 00:04:56.898
She wants it
on the side.
她的酱料要分开放

00:04:56.942 --> 00:04:58.465
On the side. On the side.
分开放 分开放

00:04:58.508 --> 00:05:00.032
[ALL CHEERING]
分开放 分开放

00:05:00.075 --> 00:05:01.468
MALE ANIMAL:
Go, Dragon Warrior! You can do it!
加油 神龙大侠 你能行

00:05:01.511 --> 00:05:02.672
Go, Dragon Warrior!
冲啊 神龙大侠 保卫村庄

00:05:02.686 --> 00:05:03.905
Defend the Valley!
冲啊 神龙大侠 保卫村庄

00:05:03.949 --> 00:05:05.385
FEMALE ANIMAL 1:
Dragon Warrior!
神龙大侠

00:05:05.428 --> 00:05:08.127
[ALL CHEERING][BLOWS]

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.563
FEMALE ANIMAL 2:
Go, Dragon Warrior!
神龙大侠

00:05:09.606 --> 00:05:11.217
Defend the Valley!
耶 保卫村庄

00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:16.265
Yee-haw!

00:05:16.309 --> 00:05:18.320
You guys aren't doing
the Dramatic Pose, are you?
你们这该不会是气震山河之势吧

00:05:18.323 --> 00:05:20.922
Do we have to strike a pose
every time we land?
咱能不每次出场都摆个造型吗

00:05:20.966 --> 00:05:22.794
You guys,
never underestimate
各位 绝不要低估了盛大出场的威力

00:05:22.837 --> 00:05:24.375
the power
of a Dramatic Entrance.
各位 绝不要低估了盛大出场的威力

00:05:24.388 --> 00:05:25.927
I've heard about
some masters who can win a fight
听说某些大师出场的阵仗之大

00:05:25.971 --> 00:05:27.320
just by throwing
open a door.
光靠开门亮相就能闪瞎对手

00:05:28.756 --> 00:05:30.323
Oh!

00:05:30.366 --> 00:05:31.715
Dramatic Entrance?
盛大出场

00:05:31.759 --> 00:05:32.978
Master Shifu.
师父 神龙大侠说得对

00:05:33.021 --> 00:05:34.980
The Dragon Warrior
is correct.
师父 神龙大侠说得对

00:05:35.023 --> 00:05:36.720
Really?
I was just making...
是吗 我只是在瞎说

00:05:36.764 --> 00:05:38.722
Uh, yeah. I mean, yeah.
I am.
对 没错 我说得对

00:05:38.815 --> 00:05:41.987
Before the battle of the fist
comes the battle of the mind.
在交战之前 意念已经开战

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.616
Hence,
the Dramatic Entrance.
因此 出场要有阵势

